
# ── iOS signing material ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Produced by scripts/ios-signing/. A committed .key or .p12 is a compromised
# signing identity: anyone with it can ship an app as you, and revoking means
# invalidating every build already in TestFlight.
*.p12
*.key
*.cer
*.csr
*.mobileprovision
secrets-to-paste/
__pycache__/
